  "method_scope": {
    "test_unbound_default_missing_ref_and_old_go_before_execution": "借原default/missing GO、empty PLAN/current GO合同；新增SYNC None、refs/binary缺项和58refs计数；旧GO scope/digest硬拒。",
    "test_complete_sequence_fifty_ms_no_ack_three_writes_and_trace": "借原happy三PV/三写及write-strace替身；首写改单ID SYNC0且无ACK，Goal读回10/70ms下均按发送完成到Enable至少50ms。",
    "test_constructor_initial_left7_stop_failure_sticky_without_later_uart": "借R2构造期guard：左7普通TE/PV/GV非零/未知在首次snapshot路径粘性，之后UART0/写0。",
    "test_no_old_gv_write_unknown_tool_or_other_target": "借原write whitelist负控，新增拒普通GV0、新SYNC其他ID/extra值/未知工具/前缀绕过。",
    "test_valid_nonzero_pv_keeps_te0_cleanup_unknown_frame_or_ack_latches": "借原有效PV0032/8032原TE0 cleanup、坏raw/Goal读回/写stdout未知与停止非零粘性。",
    "test_lower_bound_expiry_and_original_deferred_stop_unknown": "借原DEFERRED/整体FAIL/STOPUNKNOWN及期限门；同一方法追加50ms提前Enable、生产数值GO到期前/后Enable与TE原读回0/2同点到期，私有到期不能掩盖原语义。"
  },
  "minimal_changes": [
    "RUN_ID/scope/helper70及新SYNC pin入PLAN；55旧refs+helper70+newmain+SYNC应58，binary_paths仅追加本SYNC ELF。",
    "原第一Goal0改精确sync-zero(noACK)，原TE1/TE0普通WRITE ACK与write_index/STOP51不变。",
    "发送完成monotonic固定50ms下界，postGoal读回耗时计入，不续GO/补读/重试。",
    "R2构造期普通停止读取粘性及轻量GO前后门；只有production now>=expires的私有GOExpired保原已尝试Enable后的TE0/停止读取cleanup。",
    "同份raw完整帧及入口/Goal/TE语义先于返回GO；有效非零观察PV仍原TE0收尾，坏/未知/身份/停止非零仍manual禁所有后续UART。",
    "只为精确SYNC+TE两WRITE加strace；helper70普通PV7/8/9捕获不新增UART，journal和run追加metadata差异保留。",
    "timed_raw仅本次sequence及commands均增加才关联stdout；无法启动不冒领上一command。"
  ],
